      <p class="mb-6 max-w-[720px] text-xl leading-[1.7] text-secondary">
I’m Zdeněk Barth, a full-stack developer focused on building useful products. Open to new opportunities.</p>
      <a class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-4 rounded-sm border border-ink bg-ink px-4 text-xs leading-[1.6] font-bold text-paper transition-[transform,background-color,color] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-blue-hover hover:bg-blue-hover motion-reduce:transform-none motion-reduce:transition-none" href="#projects">
